## 7. OPERATIONALIZATION

The conceptual framework becomes experimentally relevant only when its concepts can be instantiated.

The operational sequence was therefore:

Concept

→ Define entity

→ Define operational specification

→ Define authority

→ Define capabilities

→ Define constraints

→ Define affected entities

→ Define relevant information

→ Define uncertainty

→ Interact with AI

→ Observe behaviour

→ Examine configuration implications

The important transition is:

> The framework was not merely discussed as an abstract philosophical proposition; it was used as an operational structure for interaction with an AI system.

This distinction is important.

A conceptual framework can describe what an AI safety mechanism might do.

An operational framework must provide a mechanism that can actually be instantiated and evaluated.

